
### watch a movie
PUT {{protocol}}{{host}}:{{port}}/api/v1/accounts/me/watchlist/2872718
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json


### delete watched movie
DELETE {{protocol}}{{host}}:{{port}}/api/v1/accounts/me/watchlist/2872718
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
